---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="100% Freshness Guarantee & Refund Policy | Hariram Namkeen"
  description="Our zero-risk freshness guarantee. Quick cancellations, damaged transit replacements, and instant UPI refunds on Hariram Namkeen orders across India."
>
  <!-- BreadcrumbList Structured Data -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://hariramnamkeen.com/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "Returns & Refund Policy",
        "item": "https://hariramnamkeen.com/returns/"
      }
    ]
  })} />

  <Header />

  <main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-inner">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">
        <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        Back to Home
      </a>

      <header class="policy-header">
        <div class="sec-tag"><span>✦</span> POLICIES &amp; RETURNS</div>
        <h1>Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
        <p class="policy-meta">Last Updated: March 2026 · Hariram Namkeen, Muzaffarnagar</p>
      </header>

      <article class="policy-body">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Nature of Our Artisanal Food Products</h2>
          <p>
            At Hariram Namkeen, we take immense pride in crafting genuine Uttar Pradesh namkeen fried fresh in pure yellow mustard oil with zero preservatives, chemicals, or palm oil.
          </p>
          <p>
            Because our items are perishable edible consumables, <strong>we cannot accept physical returns of opened or consumed food packages</strong> due to food safety and hygiene regulations. However, your complete satisfaction is our foremost priority ("ग्राहक देव तुल्य"), and we stand 100% behind the quality of every pack we ship.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Order Cancellations</h2>
          <p>
            Because all batches are prepared fresh upon receiving your order:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>You can cancel your order free of charge within <strong>2 hours</strong> of placing it, or at any time before your batch has entered the frying/dispatch cycle.</li>
            <li>To request a cancellation, immediately reach out to our team on WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/916396122920">+91 63961 22920</a> or email <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:namaste@hariramnamkeen.com">namaste@hariramnamkeen.com</a><!--/email_off--> with your order details.</li>
            <li>If the order has already been dispatched with our logistics partner, it cannot be cancelled in transit.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Damaged, Defective, or Incorrect Deliveries</h2>
          <p>
            If your package meets any of the following conditions upon delivery:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>The outer shipping carton or the pack is punctured, crushed, or visibly damaged in transit.</li>
            <li>You received an incorrect product or missing packs compared to your invoice.</li>
            <li>There is an unusual quality defect or broken seal.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            <strong>What to do:</strong> Please contact us within <strong>48 hours</strong> of receiving the shipment. Share a photo or short video showing the issue along with your order details via WhatsApp (<a href="https://wa.me/916396122920">+91 63961 22920</a>) or email (<!--email_off--><a href="mailto:namaste@hariramnamkeen.com">namaste@hariramnamkeen.com</a><!--/email_off-->).
          </p>
          <p class="resolution-card">
            <strong>Immediate Resolution:</strong> Once reviewed (usually within a few business hours), we will promptly offer you either:
            <br />1. A complimentary replacement pack dispatched at our own cost, OR
            <br />2. A full 100% refund credited back to your original payment method.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Refund Processing Timeframe</h2>
          <p>
            Once a refund is approved by our support desk:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>UPI &amp; Instant Wallets:</strong> Processed within 24 to 48 hours.</li>
            <li><strong>Credit Card, Debit Card, &amp; Net Banking:</strong> Processed and reflected in your banking account statement within 5 to 7 business days, depending on your issuing bank.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Customer Support Desk</h2>
          <div class="contact-card">
            <p><strong>Hariram Namkeen Care Desk</strong></p>
            <p>Main Market, Muzaffarnagar, Uttar Pradesh - 251001, India</p>
            <p>Phone / WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/916396122920">+91 63961 22920</a></p>
            <p>Email: <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:namaste@hariramnamkeen.com">namaste@hariramnamkeen.com</a><!--/email_off--></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.policy-page {
  padding: 130px 0 100px;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.policy-inner {
  max-width: 820px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 var(--gutter);
}

.back-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--maroon);
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
  transition: transform .2s, color .2s;
}

.back-link:hover {
  transform: translateX(-4px);
  color: var(--maroon-l);
}

.policy-header {
  margin-bottom: 40px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(194, 127, 21, 0.2);
  padding-bottom: 24px;
}

.policy-header h1 {
  font-family: var(--F);
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 46px);
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.15;
  margin: 12px 0 8px;
}

.policy-meta {
  font-size: 13.5px;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-weight: 500;
}

.policy-body section {
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.policy-body h2 {
  font-family: var(--F);
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--maroon);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.policy-body p {
  font-size: 15.5px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.policy-body strong {
  color: var(--text);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.policy-body ul {
  list-style: disc;
  padding-left: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}

.policy-body li {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.resolution-card {
  background: rgba(14, 115, 55, 0.08);
  border-left: 4px solid #0e7337;
  padding: 14px 18px;
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 16px 0;
}

.contact-card {
  background: rgba(79, 14, 14, 0.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(79, 14, 14, 0.12);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.contact-card p {
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  font-size: 14.5px;
}

.contact-card a, .policy-body a {
  color: var(--maroon);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: underline;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .policy-page {
    padding: 100px 0 60px;
  }
}
</style>
